  "title": "Fresh & Smooth",
  "description": "Making Minecraft As Animated, and As Fresh As possible while remaining fully client-based (similar to Actions & Stuff pack)",
  "body": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Fresh & Smooth</h1>\n\nThis is a **modpack** dedicated to mods and texture packs that **makes the game more alive** and make it feel as fresh (and smooth) as possible.\n\nYou can also try this modpack on Curseforge! [CF Fresh n' Smooth modpack](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fresh-and-smooth)\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_srPykohHSQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Tq6TZfTmhZA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<h3>What is it inspired by?</h3>\n\nThe main **inspiration** behind this project were two add-ons, **[Actions & Stuff](https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/marketplace/pdp?id=61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795)** and **[Realistic Biomes](https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/marketplace/pdp?id=2249c366-c812-4fe5-a6ec-abe9d6bea6bc).**\n\nThe mod pack is available for **1.21.5** and **1.21.11** **fabric**; in light of the amount of mods here, the performance is smooth, but require a capable computer, more emphasis on the Processor due to animations and particles.\n\n<h2>credits to mods that aren't on the modrinth ecosystem:</h2>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/action-s-amp-stuff-pumpkin-no-blur/\n\"> Action and stuff pumpkins</a></li>\n\n\n  <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-tridents\"> Better Trident</a></li>\n\n\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/luminous\"> Lumious 1.4</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n- [Sildur's enhanced default](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/sildurs-enhanced-default)\n\n- [Locomotion By James 1.21.10+ only](https://github.com/Trainguy9512/locomotion/tags)\n\n\n**IMPORTANT:** to avoid FPS drops, play this modpack on a server, **this way your processor only handle the visuals**, whilst the server handles the entities and the chunks, if you don't believe me, try running my modpack on a server vs on singleplayer.\n\nAny Reputable Service is fine, but if you'd like to support me, use **[Pinehosting](https://pine.host/enderverse)**, write my Code \"ENDER\" and you'll get 30% your 1st month!\n\n<h2>Take a look at this video!</h2>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/hV6BZ-LhxbA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n",
